window.products.push({"id":1015104,"name":"BUODREPE Professional Silicone Oven Mitts，4 Pcs Oven Mitt Set，Oven Mitts Heat Resistant 500℉ for Kitchen Cooking，Pot Holders，Oven Gloves with Soft Qui","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71NcQ6CA-jL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Oven Mitts and Mini Oven Hand Clips Set】BUODREPE oven mitt are made of professional food-grade silicone (BPA-free), which double-protected, which can meet all baking, grilling, and daily cooking needs. The mini oven mitts are light, cute, and convenient, suitable for grabbing hot dishes and pans, toaster, and bread maker. 【Heat Resistance and Waterproof】The silicone surface and organic cotton of oven mittens can provide effective protection at temperatures up to 500℉.At the same time, 100% of the silicone surface does not absorb any liquid, which can effectively prevent hot water, steam, and heat oil, making cooking safer. 【Safe Cooking, No Burns!】13.7\" oven mitts provide better protection for fingers, hands, and wrists from burns. The extended protection design from the fingers to the wrist keeps you away from being burned by hot gas and liquid while cooking. Kitchen oven gloves and Mini oven mitts combination make you use kitchen appliances flexibly, have a fantastic cooking experience. 【Easy to Clean and Storage】Unlike the cotton cooking gloves on the market that are not stained resistant and difficult to clean, BUODREPE kitchen baking gloves due to the nature of its waterproof, can effectively resist stains. It can be easily cleaned with only warm water and a little soap. The cotton lining inside can be pulled out for cleaning, and the hook design is easy to storage. 【Anti-Slip Design】BUODREPE kitchen mittens have spiral texture design, which is not only fashionable and beautiful but also provides a better grip. It can prevent the hot and slippery kitchen utensils from falling from your hands. the organic cotton lining makes it softer and more comfortable to wear. Makes you have a better cooking experience!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71NcQ6CA-jL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BUODREPE","source_asin":"B08TWB6FNY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1015104","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08TWB6FNY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08TWB6FNY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
