window.products.push({"id":1015119,"name":"Nictemaw Bread Machine, 2LB 25-in-1 Digital Touch Panel + Programmable Bread Maker, 3 Loaf Sizes 3 Crust Colors,Stainless Steel","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7104VP23nNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🍞【Multifunctional with 25 Customized Automatic Programs, 2LB Large Capacity】This breadmaker has settings for light, medium or dark crust, different loaf capacity from 1, 1.5 and 2 lb. It also has 25 programs to choose from (QUICK BREAD, WHOLE-WHEAT, GLUTEN FREE, JAM, etc.) 🍩【15 Hours Time Delay & 60-Min Keep Warm Function】 15-hour delay start function allows you to say goodbye to getting up early. You only need to put the ingredients in the bread bucket before going to bed, make an appointment for 9 hours after selecting the program, enjoy fresh and delicious bread in the morning. 60-Min keep warm function can keep the bread hot and tasty. Also, It has a built-in 15-minute power interruption recovery. Let you achieve nutritious breakfast more freedom. 🥞【Intuitive Digital Touch Panel Control and Stainless Steel Shell】 Large viewing digital window is easy to view and select the cycle, crust, and loaf size. Stainless steel heat-resistant and not easy to damage, baked bread more delicious and healthy. Homemade bread is not only tastier but also healthier (fresher & less chemicals). 🥖【Non-stick Ceramic Pan & Upgraded Button Design】Non-stick ceramic pan with 5 layers of protection, easy to take out & clean. 360°surrounded baking to make bread baked evenly more healthier & fresher. Separate knead and gluten free button support knead dough and make gluten-free bread quickly. Magic kneading paddle make stronger mixing power & more efficient. 🍰【Stainless Steel Modern Design & Practical Accessories Included】To provide a high-quality product, adopted stainless steel for this amazing bread maker to ensure the durability. You could see and control the bread-making process at any time through the big view window. Ceramic Pan, Kitchen Glove, User Manual, Measuring cup, Measuring spoon, Hook and Other Versatile Accessories Included.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7104VP23nNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Nictemaw","source_asin":"B09BQGQTJ3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1015119","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09BQGQTJ3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09BQGQTJ3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
