window.products.push({"id":1015168,"name":"MYMULIKE Motorized Rotating Display Stand, jewelry display turntable, 5.71inch /22LB Load, 360 Degree Turntable Display Stand for Photography Products","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61j8sYMuM6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Rotación silenciosa y suave】: este soporte de exhibición giratorio tiene velocidad controlable y dirección y ángulo ajustables. ①R/L gira en sentido horario o antihorario para cambiar. ②La velocidad de la 3.ª marcha SR se ajusta a 8 segundos, 15 segundos y 30 segundos por vuelta. ③ASA puede ajustar el ángulo de rotación de 90° alternativo y 180° alternativo. Encendido: haga clic en cualquier tecla para encender, apagar: mantenga presionada cualquier tecla durante 3 segundos para apagar. [Motor silencioso]: movimiento de alta calidad, rotación continua y suave, materias primas de primera clase, bajo nivel de ruido, bajo consumo de energía, el diámetro del soporte de la plataforma giratoria es de 14,6 cm * la altura es de 3,5 cm y el peso es de 0,3 kg. La carga máxima es de 10 kg. El tocadiscos fotográfico motorizado tiene buena estabilidad y capacidad de carga. Brinda excelentes resultados para la filmación de videos y demostraciones de productos. 【Amplia gama de usos】: Conveniente y fácil de operar, estable y seguro. Los soportes de exhibición giratorios son ideales para exhibición de joyas, modelos 3D, exhibición de electrónica digital, relojes y otras exhibiciones de productos pequeños, accesorios fotográficos, fotomatones de 360° en tiendas, estudios, bibliotecas escolares, salas de exhibición y más. [Dos modos de fuente de alimentación]: fuente de alimentación USB y fuente de alimentación giratoria de batería de litio 18650. 3 horas de carga rápida, 8 horas de duración de la batería, fácil de usar Simplemente conecte el tocadiscos (cable USB incluido) al adaptador de corriente, banco de energía y computadora [Configuración completa]: el paquete incluye un soporte de exhibición giratorio, un cable USB y una placa de fondo (excluyendo las baterías).","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61j8sYMuM6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MYMULIKE","source_asin":"B09N8Q3XMH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1015168","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09N8Q3XMH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09N8Q3XMH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1015169,"name":"Austrian KB Collection Sand Picture Screen Grey","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":43.54,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Kpi3YTdmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This is a sand picture made in Austria by Kraus Besh. What is Sand Picture?: This artwork allows you to draw a variety of pictures by moving freely between two sealed glass plates, such as water, air, and specific gravity. When the picture is upsided, the sand begins to fall off, drawing a variety of scenes like a sand dune or mountain. It also has a 3D effect, so you can enjoy a different expression every time. The sand drop speed is determined by the amount of air in the frame, and the included injector can be used to inflate and exit the speed of the sand. Enjoy the world of sand art in the first party that creates a completely different picture every time you flip it over.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Kpi3YTdmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KB collection(ケイビーコレクション)","source_asin":"B001RPWGOK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1015169","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B001RPWGOK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B001RPWGOK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
