window.products.push({"id":1015224,"name":"MyBevi Classic Stainless Steel Premium Grade Insulated Travel Tumbler (Green Mirror, 26 oz)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41XWDpzTakL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"TEMPERATURE CONTROL – Our vacuum-insulated premium stainless-steel tumbler is a state-of-the-art travel tumbler. A stainless steel and copper-coated inner lining keeps liquids at the desired temperature for up to 12 hours without affecting the flavor, and the tapered body style allows for a comfortable grip, plus it fits into most car and truck cup holders. HIGH QUALITY – MyBevi redefines tumbler toughness. A great grip and temperature control mean you’ll never want to get rid of your tumbler, and a balance of clarity, chemical resistance, and durability means you’ll never have to. NO SPLASH LIDS – A tumbler without a lid is a cup; not much use on the go. So we use a Tritan lid, which is made of a unique, durable plastic that is break and crack resistant. It will last as long as your tumbler. It comes with a carry ring and slide tab straw hole to make sure that no matter where you are and what you’re doing, a refreshing drink at the right temperature is right at hand. BPA FREE – BPAs are bad for the environment, dangerous to humans, and affect taste – and our travel tumblers will have none of that. Whether for work, for play, or for training, you deserve a premium-grade tumbler – and with MyBevi, that’s exactly what you’ll get. DRINK LIFE TO THE FULLEST – It’s time you had a tumbler that was sleek, safe, and most importantly, did its job. Hydration is necessary, and your travel tumbler should reflect its importance. You need a tumbler that grips well, keeps liquids at the right temperature, and won’t spill. Get the most out of life and get the most out of your mug, and drink life to the fullest.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41XWDpzTakL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MyBevi","source_asin":"B07DP61B9C","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1015224","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07DP61B9C","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07DP61B9C","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
