window.products.push({"id":1015594,"name":"Juicer Machines Vegetable and Fruit, HOUSNAT Cold Press Juicer Extractor with 2-Speed Modes Easy to Clean, Slow Masticating Juicer with Quiet Motor, R","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":88.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71DT5HRHEeL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"👉Soft and Hard Modes👈: The cold press juicer has two modes, soft and hard, which allow for customization of ingredients. With its versatile design, a wide range of ingredients can be used to make healthy drinks. \"Soft\" mode is perfect for soft ingredients such as tomatoes, kale, oranges, and spinach, while \"hard\" mode is ideal for celery, apples, carrots, and ginger. This multi-purpose ability ensures that every juice is healthy and delicious. 👉Spiral Masticating System👈: The upgraded 7 segment spiral masticating system of the slow juicer ensures maximum juice extraction and separation of pulp, resulting in a higher juice yield enriched in aroma, natural taste, and nutrients like vitamins and minerals. The process is efficient, quiet, and simple, making it an ideal addition to any kitchen. 👉Easy to Disassemble & Clean👈: Disassembling and cleaning the juicer is easy with the one-button assembly design. Reverse function prevents ingredients from getting stuck, and the equipped brush make cleaning a breeze. All detachable parts are made of high-grade food-grade materials, ensuring durability and longevity of the product. 👉Durable & Quiet Motor👈: The slow juicer is equipped with a durable motor that can work for years. With a low-speed but powerful DC motor that operates at less than 60dB, the juicer is quiet and won't cause disturbance to family members. 👉Long-Lasting Freshness👈: The low rpm process used in masticating juicers introduces very little heat into the juice and slows down the oxidation process of the raw ingredients. As a result, the juice produced by this cold press juicer has a shelf-life of 72 hours in the refrigerator without losing any of its nutritional value. This ensures long-lasting freshness of the juice, making it the perfect addition to a healthy lifestyle. 👉Small Caliber, Safe Juicing👈: This masticating juicer boasts a small feeder chute that ensures safe juicing without any risks of injuries. For the best flavor, it is suggested to deseed the fruits while chopping them to prevent any bitter aftertaste. Whether it's a morning routine or a family get-together, this slow masticating juicer extractor enables you and your loved ones to relish fresh juices every day.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71DT5HRHEeL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HOUSNAT","source_asin":"B09TKX4C4M","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1015594","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09TKX4C4M","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09TKX4C4M","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
