window.products.push({"id":1015607,"name":"Buy4Wall Audrey Hepburn Wall Art Canvas Print Breakfast at Tiffany`s Picture on The Table Vintage Home Decor Framed Artwork - Ready to Hang -%100 Hand","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81vFVI2I+sL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Proudly Made in the USA.  MADE TO ORDER:  All products made to order. So please make sure about your order size is correct before checking out. STRETCHER BARS:  We use 0.75\" thick stretcher bars and all durable shrink resistant frames for gallery quality profile. Only 30\" x 40\" and 40\" x 30\" stretcher bars are 1.50\" thick. READY TO HANG: Our canvas prints are READY TO HANG unless stated ROLLED UP in the size option. ROLLED UP OPTION (Only for 30\" x 40\" or 40\" x 30\" size)  We have two options for 30\" x 40\" or 40\" x 30\" sizes. If you chose ROLLED UP size option, your canvas will come rolled up in a tube and it will be NOT READY TO HANG. When you stretched the canvas, you will need borders so mirroring borders will be added to the actual picture. You will receive the canvas bigger than actual size which is stated in the size option because of the mirroring. Rolled up canvas will be 34\" x 44\" or 44\" x 34\" including mirroring borders (2\" for each edge). When you stretched the canvas, we suggest you use up to 1.5\" thick (Depth) and 30\" x 40\" or 40\" x 30\" (Height x Width) stretcher bars for the best result. CANVAS MIRRORED BORDERS: All the products have mirroring edges to keep all image on the front of the canvas. A portion of your image will be mirrored or reflected over the sides. The image does not wrap around the stretcher bars. The result look keeps the original image in full view. NOTE: Due to differing calibration of every monitor, actual canvas colors may be slightly different from the product image.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81vFVI2I+sL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Buy4Wall","source_asin":"B07795XHQH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1015607","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07795XHQH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07795XHQH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
