window.products.push({"id":1015788,"name":"Snowdool 40X32 Front and Backlit Mirror Bathroom LED Mirror, Anti-Fog Bathroom Mirror with Lights, Stepless Dimmable, 3 Colors Lighted Vanity Mirror, ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":319.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/610yEamx5XL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Double Lights, Front lights and Backlit, Brighter and Clearer】Snowdool LED Mirror for Bathroom are double lighted, with both front and back led strips, 192 light beads, brighter than the mirror only with front light/Backlit Vanity Mirror. The Bathroom Vanity Mirror will bring enough lights for makeup, shaving, skin care and dressing up, also beautify the bathroom. 【3 Color Temperature & Dimmable & Memory Function】This Lighted Bathroom Mirror has 3 touch buttons, long press the touch switch to adjust the brightness. Both backlight and front light could be dimmable. Short press the light button choose 3 color temperature, warm light (3000k), natural light (4000k), and white light (6000k). Memory function helps remember the last setting that you’ve used, smart mirror, smart home. 【Shatter-Proof Glass & Anti-Fog & Safer to Use】Do you worry about fragility when buying a mirror? Different from other mirrors, Ours led vanity mirror is designed with 5MM tempered glass which features shatter-proof, explosion-proof. Sturdy, durable and safe to use. Short press the \"Anti-fog Button\" to enter defog quick and one hour auto-off of continuous use. Only need a few minutes to get a clear reflection image. 【Easy to Install, Two ways Powered, Plug-in/Hardwired】The lighted bathroom mirrors for wall is easy to install with fixed the mirror holder on the wall by screws and hang the mirror on the holder. The led mirror can be powered by hardwired or plugged in. Also easy to clean ( can hangs vertically or horizontally). 【5-Years-Warranty & 100% Satisfaction】We will provide 5 years warranty for Snowdool smart bathroom mirror. We are constantly improving our packaging to ensure that our bathroom led mirror arrive intact. If the bathroom mirror is damaged or broken upon arrival, please contact us in time, and we will provide a reasonable solution within 24 hours. 💙Tips: The white light of the button means turn on, the blue light means standby, long press the button can turn off the blue light.\"","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/610yEamx5XL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Snowdool","source_asin":"B0BQHLG7JV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1015788","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BQHLG7JV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BQHLG7JV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
