window.products.push({"id":1015811,"name":"Little Critterz \"Mohawk\" Wolf Cub LC126","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61lmnVZ4oHL._AC_SL1425_.jpg","description":"Little Critterz began years ago in the beautiful town of Bellagio, on Lake Como in northern Italy. Our founders discovered exquisite animal beautiful figurines in a small shop which they then sourced and further developed into the exquisite line you see today. And so Little Critterz was born. Our miniatures are crafted in the lush mountains and verdant plains of Thailand where people have cared for and loved animals since the beginning of their national story. Each figurine is hand crafted and hand painted by skilled artisans using brushes only a few hairs thick. Little Critterz product line has expanded to include Ornaments, Jewelry, Animal Patches, Animal Pins, and more on the way. The team at Little Critterz takes inspiration from the diversity of the animal world and delights in the wonderment both children and adults can feel when encountering the natural world for the first time, reminding us to protect of this planet’s amazing creatures. We take pride in sharing their stories so that we can protect these animals and their habitats. This wonderful planet and its creatures should be a heritage we can all admire and enjoy. UNIQUE, COLLECTIBLE, TIMELESS: Each figurine is unique, and no two are exactly alike, just as in nature where each animal is an individual in color and detail. Our figurines are meant to be collectibles or gifts. They will remind you of a time, place, friend or loved one, as you appreciate the amazing details. DÉCOR: Create a diorama in your garden, terrarium, aquarium, or display in your home as an accent piece. You can mix and match to create your own animal kingdom. PRODUCT SAFETY: Little Critterz figurines are decorative items intended for ages 13+. Warning! Choking Hazard. Small parts. Not for children under 3 years.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61lmnVZ4oHL._AC_SL1425_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Little Critterz","source_asin":"B00689EN8M","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1015811","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00689EN8M","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00689EN8M","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
