window.products.push({"id":1015889,"name":"Hallmark Christmas Ornament, Llama, Wood","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Zf--7VOrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Add a touch of holiday whimsy to any home with this charming Christmas ornament hanging from the tree. You're sure to \"llove\" the rustic wood design of a stately llama with a colorfully painted saddle blanket on its back. Made of wood, this Hallmark Ornament measures 2.36 x 3.94 x 0.98 inches. The ornament is ready to hang on your Christmas tree with a hanger attachment. Great gift idea for family and friends who love llamas. Hallmark Ornaments are a great way to commemorate hobbies, life events and individual interests. Each festive and collectible ornament is perfect for sharing with family and friends. Hallmark has been your family-owned creator of greeting cards, Christmas tree ornaments, gifts, gift wrap and more for over 100 years. We take deep pride in helping individuals connect in just the right way.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Zf--7VOrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hallmark","source_asin":"B089P2DBGX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1015889","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B089P2DBGX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B089P2DBGX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1015890,"name":"BUSH FURNITURE Bush Furniture Vantage Pure Corner Desk, 48-Inch, White","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31PllYDJ8OL._AC_.jpg","description":"Style, craftsmanship and a distinctive contemporary look for your home office all come standard with the Bush Furniture Vantage 48\"Corner Desk. Full functionality in a compact footprint works anywhere. Generous work surface area lets you keep projects spread out. Two box drawers hold supplies while one file drawer accepts letter-size files. Wide retracting keyboard and mouse shelf is out of sight yet at your fingertips. Elevated shelf supports printer or other peripherals. Attractive frosted glass door conceals computer CPUs providing access and management for all wires, cords and cables. Store binders and personal items via the adjustable/removable shelf for supplies or files. Open storage cubbies let you organize papers and keep important work close at hand. Polished pewter pulls add a posh touch to any décor. Long-term value, with rugged, solid surfaces and attractive Pure White finish, stands up to punishment and retains its good looks. Includes Bush Furniture 1-year warranty.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31PllYDJ8OL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bush Furniture","source_asin":"B00BVNV9V4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1015890","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00BVNV9V4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00BVNV9V4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1015891,"name":"Trademark Fine Art Homage to Monet by David Lloyd Glover Canvas Wall Art, 26x32-Inch","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":58.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/717yw0iN-zL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"This ready to hang, gallery wrapped art piece features a pond. David Lloyd Glover has a 25 year internation reputation exhibiting in major galleries in the US, Canada, Mexico and Japan. His works have been acquired by collectors all over the world. Glover creates masterworks in watercolor on paper, gouache on paper, oil on canvas and acrylic on canvas with equal facility. After a career in the advertising industry he embarked on a full time vocation of creating fine art for gallery sales. Giclee (jee-clay) is an advanced printmaking process for creating high quality fine art reproductions. The attainable excellence that Giclee printmaking affords makes the reproduction virtually indistinguishable from the original piece. The result is wide acceptance of Giclee by galleries, museums, and private collectors. Gallery wrap is a method of stretching an artist's canvas so that the canvas wraps around the sides and is secured a hidden, wooden frame. This method of stretching and preparing a canvas allows for a frameless presentation of the finished painting.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/717yw0iN-zL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Trademark Fine Art","source_asin":"B00BLY6UQW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1015891","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00BLY6UQW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00BLY6UQW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
